01:00:00,000 --> 01:00:06,000
The Ron Clark Story (also known as The Triumph) is a 2006
American television film starring Matthew Perry.

13
01:05:00,000 --> 01:05:06,000
The film is based on the educator Ron Clark.

14
01:10:00,000 --> 01:10:06,000
